            {
              name: CREATOR_SW_CFG_DIO_ATTR
              size: 76
              desc:
                '''
                Pinmux DIO Pads Configuration
                There are 73 DIO pads, and because we want to align
                those 73 bytes on a 32-bit word without affecting the
                rest of the partition, we added some padding with 3
                extra bytes at the end.
                This alignment requirement comes from OTP which only
                accepts 32-bit accesses.

                Each byte is described as follows:
                0: pull-up enable
                1: pull-down enable
                2: schmitt trigger enable
                3: reserved
                4-6: drive strength
                7: override enable

                List of bytes
                0: SpiHost0Sd0
                1: SpiHost0Sd1
                2: SpiHost0Sd2
                3: SpiHost0Sd3
                4: SpiDeviceSd0
